# =============================================================================
# Sweep + audit artefacts (regenerated on every run)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This umbrella ignores the entire results/ tree, including:
#   - results/joern_cpg_cache/          (~4 GB of Joern CPG bins, fully regenerable)
#   - results/joern_only_k0_archives/   (shipped archives of joern-only k=0 sweeps)
#   - results/joern/<timestamp>/        (per-sweep output dirs)
#   - results/semgrep/<timestamp>/      (per-sweep output dirs)
# Pre-paper history committed before this rule was added stays tracked
# (use `git rm --cached` if you want to remove it later).
# =============================================================================
results/

# =============================================================================
# Paper draft assets and rendered tables/plots (not tracked on main)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paper/                 = main_results.tex/.pdf, figure PNGs, submission zip
# PlotsTables/           = generated CSVs / Markdown tables / PNGs from sweeps
# _local/                = scratch dir for local-only experiments
# *.tar.gz at repo root  = sweep tarballs created by ad-hoc shell scripts
# =============================================================================
Paper/
PlotsTables/
_local/
/*.tar.gz
